### Create project
POST http://localhost:8082/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "First Project",
  "description": "My first project in task-service",
  "ownerId": 1
}

### Get all projects
GET http://localhost:8082/projects

### Create task
POST http://localhost:8082/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "First Task",
  "description": "My first task",
  "status": "TODO",
  "priority": "HIGH",
  "assigneeId": 1,
  "createdBy": 1,
  "projectId": 1
}

### Get all tasks
GET http://localhost:8082/tasks

### Create comment
POST http://localhost:8082/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "This is my first comment",
  "authorId": 1,
  "taskId": 1
}

### Get comments by task
GET http://localhost:8082/comments/by-task/1